<title>FRANCE: Paribas no comment on Cr du Nord sale talk.</title>
<headline>Paribas no comment on Cr du Nord sale talk.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groupe Paribas chairman Andre Levy-Lang refused to comment on Wednesday on a rumour that the bank was planning to sell its Credit du Nord unit.</p>
<p>&quot;We never comment on rumours,&quot; Levy-Lang said in response to a question at a luncheon with members of the foreign press club.</p>
<p>In welcoming remarks opening the luncheon, Levy-Lang called Credit du Nord &quot;very complementary&quot; to Paribas' business.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
